<p>-- Note: COPA consists of Archer Daniels Midland Co, CanAmera Foods, Canbra Foods Ltd and Northern Lite Canola Inc with crush data also provided by Cargill Ltd, the Canadian unit of Minnesota-based Cargill Inc. -- R=revised.</p>
